Package: ArthOMixShinyApp
Type: Project
Title: ArthOMix Multi-Omics Rheumatoid Arthritis Shiny Application
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A hand-rolled classic-Shiny app (ui.R/server.R/global.R + R/
    submodules) implementing Transcriptomics, Methylomics, Cross-Omics and
    Multi-Omics analysis workflows. This DESCRIPTION documents the package
    dependency surface for reproducibility; it is not used to build an R
    package and does not change how the app boots (no golem/app.R
    conversion was performed - see renv.lock in this same directory for the
    exact package versions this snapshot was taken against).
